app
  ctrl+c  ^c  quit  on
  ?       ?   help  on

checks
  esc       esc     detail        on
  ctrl+r    ^r      rerun failed  on
  r ctrl+r  r       refresh       on
  o         o       browser       on
  enter     ↵       log           on
  up k      ↑/k     up            on
  down j    ↓/j     down          on
  pgup b    pgup/b  page up       on
  pgdown f  pgdn/f  page down     on
  home g    g/home  first         on
  end G     G/end   last          on
  A         A       annotations   off
